      "side": 1,
      "message": "yea, I used to consider that as well. my understanding is AudioCodecConfig is using bitmap and more for source audio capability config, while the value here is matching a different assigned num map for assistant/sink meta data audio config. Considering those values are originally coming from Spec(e.g. assigned num, 6.12.5.1) and there they maintained separate tables, i think maybe it\u0027s better to have a separate definition here as well to avoid confusion and the extra conversion. also i think value should be good for this subgroup level metadata, and bitmap is more for BIG group level.\ndoes this make sense?",
